  "slug": "my-chinese-teacher",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/4452_my-chinese-teacher.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Because of my work needs, I have to learn Chinese, but after studying for a while, I felt that Chinese was getting more and more difficult, a bit boring, and I didn’t want to learn it anymore. Last month, a new Chinese teacher came to teach me, and I found that her approach was very different. She would let me listen to Chinese songs, watch Chinese movies and news, and we would discuss many issues about China together. I am now interested in Chinese again."
  ],
  "english_full": "Because of my work needs, I have to learn Chinese, but after studying for a while, I felt that Chinese was getting more and more difficult, a bit boring, and I didn’t want to learn it anymore. Last month, a new Chinese teacher came to teach me, and I found that her approach was very different. She would let me listen to Chinese songs, watch Chinese movies and news, and we would discuss many issues about China together. I am now interested in Chinese again.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Из-за требова́ний моей рабо́ты я до́лжен учи́ть кита́йский, но после́ изуче́ния в то вре́мя я почу́вствовал, что кита́йский ста́л всё бо́льше и бо́льше тру́дным, немного ску́чным, и я не желал учи́ть его́ больше. Прошлый ме́сяц ко мне пришла но́вая кита́йская наста́вница, и я нашёл, что её подход был совсе́м друго́й. Она позво́лила мне слу́шать кита́йские пе́сни, смо́треть кита́йские фи́льмы и ве́сти, и мы обсужда́ли мно́гие вы́пуски о Кита́е вме́сте. Теперь я за́интересовался кита́йским опя́ть."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Iz-za trebovániy moei ráboty ya dólzhen uchít' kitáyskiy, no poslé izucheníya v to vremia ya pochúvstvoval, chto kitáyskiy stál vsé bólshe i bólshe trudnym, nemnogo skuchnym, i ya ne zhelal uchít' ego bólshe. Proshlýi mésyats ko mne prishla nóvaya kitáyskáya nastávnitsa, i ya nashól, chto yéyo podkhód byl sovsém drugóy. Ona pozvólila mne slushát' kitáyskie pésni, smotret' kitáyskie fíl'my i vésti, i my obsuzhdáli mnógiye výpuskí o Kitáye vméste. Téper' ya záinteresovalsya kitáyskim opyát'."
  ],
